@host = http://localhost:3000

### Standard-Endpunkt
GET {{host}}/

### Rezepte
GET {{host}}/recipes

### Zutaten
GET {{host}}/ingredients

### Einzelnes Rezept — id aus der Liste einsetzen
GET {{host}}/recipes/01a05dfb-c62a-7443-9462-215ebebaf729

### Unbekannte, aber gültige UUID -> 404
GET {{host}}/recipes/01a05dfb-c62a-7443-9462-215ebebaf724

### Keine UUID -> 400
GET {{host}}/recipes/hallo

### search request
GET {{host}}/recipes?search=lang

### search request
GET {{host}}/recipes?search=LANGOS

### search request
GET {{host}}/recipes?search=brot

### search request
GET {{host}}/recipes?search=xyz

### search request
GET {{host}}/recipes?search=

### post ingredient
POST {{host}}/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Paprika", "defaultUnit": "PIECE" }

### post ingredient
POST {{host}}/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lauch", "id": "abc" }

### post recipe
POST {{host}}/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kartoffelsuppe",
  "instructions": "Kartoffeln schälen …",
  "sourceUrl": "https://…",
  "ingredients": [
    { "name": "Kartoffeln", "amount": 800, "unit": "GRAM" },
    { "name": "Mehl", "amount": 1, "unit": "EL", "note": "zum Binden" },
    { "name": "Salz", "amount": 1, "unit": "TEASPOON" },
    { "name": " salz ", "note": "nach Geschmack" }
  ]
}